surer\u2019s database, indicating a clean history and no pattern of fraudulent behavior.","evidence":"claim_history.prior_claims_count=0; claim_history.prior_claims=[]"},{"id":"D3","point":"Weather records show mild, dry conditions on the incident date, matching the claim\u2019s description of normal driving and supporting the plausibility of the collision.","evidence":"weather.lowest_temp_c=5.5; weather.highest_temp_c=21.2; weather.total_precipitation_mm=0.8; weather_terms_in_description=[]"}],"summary":"All factual evidence supports a genuine loss: the damage and repair cost are reasonable, documentation is appropriate, filing was prompt, and there are no location, weather, or history inconsistencies, warranting approval of the claim."}

